OL,3,GNEWSAWhat does takeover by sportswear
OL,4,Afirm mean for traditional shoemaker?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow it has been bought by Castore,
OL,7,Fwhich makes kits for teams including
OL,8,FEverton FC and England Rugby.
